@node Performance Benchmarking
@chapter Performance Benchmarking
@cindex performance
@cindex benchmarking
@cindex timing
@cindex prompt_eval_duration
@cindex prefill timing

This chapter documents concrete, reproducible performance measurements on
a CPU-only laptop running Codebud with Ollama and the
@code{qwen2.5-coder:3b-instruct-q4_K_M} model.  Every number comes directly
from Ollama's own timing API --- there is no estimation or extrapolation.

Most of the chapter is the original benchmark of 2026-05-01 (Ollama
0.22.0), kept as a record of how the analysis was done.  Codebud and
Ollama have changed since; the follow-up measurements of 2026-10-24
(Ollama 0.40.6) are in @ref{October 2026 Results}, and they are the ones
that describe Codebud today: about 30 s for the first request of a
session and about 8 s for later ones.

